{quote}We had rolled-out a new feature regarding cancellation fees, allowing us to charge cancellation fees from the rider (through their Bolt Balance) if the selected payment method was cash. Then we discovered a bug that prevented this amount to be added to Driver/Fleet balance - causing smaller payouts on 13.03 & 20.03. Bug has been fixed and these amounts were adjusted on 24.03, therefore their payout on 27-28.03 will be higher to compensate the previous smaller payouts.{quote}

For message_type = “Campaigns”, missing message ids from the dashboard are largely limited to inbox campaigns. 
Two possible reasons for further investigation:

# Message IDs are completely missing in properties ETL
# Message IDs are parsed wrongly for NotificationInbox in properties ETL

For non-Journey campaigns, dashboard is usable for all channels except Inbox.

